SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaIntro::
    .string "I had a vision of your arrival.\p"
    .string "I have had psychic powers since I\n"
    .string "was a child.\p"
    .string "It started when a spoon I carelessly\n"
    .string "tossed, bent.\p"
    .string "I dislike battling, but if you wish, I\n"
    .string "will show you my powers!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_RulesExplain::
    .string "I foresaw this moment. But foresight\n"
    .string "cannot break rules.\p"
    .string "Three Pokémon. Fixed, as most futures\n"
    .string "are.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you wish to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to align your destiny?$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaReady::
    .string "I see you have aligned your force.\n"
    .string "Your future is set.\p"
    .string "Now, I will show you my powers!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_Refused::
    .string "As I predicted, you are not ready.\p"
    .string "Come back when you have exactly\n"
    .string "three Pokémon.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_StillNot3::
    .string "Your mind is still clouded. You do\n"
    .string "not have three Pokémon.\p"
    .string "I cannot battle you yet.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaDefeat::
    .string "This loss shocks me! But, a loss is a\n"
    .string "loss.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery1::
    .string "I admit, I didn't work hard enough to\n"
    .string "win.\p"
    .string "Your victory has earned you the\n"
    .string "Marsh Badge.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery2::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{PLAYER} received the Marsh Badge\n"
    .string "from Sabrina!$"    

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery3::
    .string "The Marsh Badge makes Pokémon up to\n"
    .string "Lv. 70 obey you.\p"
    .string "Stronger Pokémon will become wild,\n"
    .string "ignoring your orders in battle.\p"
    .string "Just don't raise your Pokémon too\n"
    .string "much to avoid that problem.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou::
    .string "Wait, please take this TM with you.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM04FromSabrina::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM04 from\n"
    .string "Sabrina.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM04::
    .string "TM04 is Calm Mind.\p"
    .string "It makes the Pokémon concentrate to\n"
    .string "raise both Sp. Atk and Sp. Def.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaPostBattle::
    .string "Psychic power isn't something that\n"
    .string "only a few people have.\p"
    .string "Everyone has psychic power. People\n"
    .string "just don't realize it.\p"
    .string "The battle has ended as destined.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaRematchIntro::
    .string "I saw you coming. Of course I did.\p"
    .string "The last time we met, my visions\n"
    .string "failed me.\p"
    .string "You were meant to lose.\n"
    .string "Yet, you did not.\p"
    .string "You are a thread the future cannot\n"
    .string "quite hold. It intrigues me.\p"
    .string "Let us see what fate you weave this\n"
    .string "time.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaRematchRules::
    .string "This time, we battle differently.\p"
    .string "Two minds against two, upon the same\n"
    .string "field.\p"
    .string "When two act as one, their fates\n"
    .string "intertwine. I wish to see yours.\p"
    .string "Bring four. With anyone else, I would\n"
    .string "already know which. With you…\l"
    .string "I cannot say.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you wish to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to organize your party?$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaRematchReady::
    .string "I know you are ready. So the future\n"
    .string "begins to move.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_RefusedRematch::
    .string "You turn away. It changes nothing.\p"
    .string "The march of time is relentless, no\n"
    .string "matter how you postpone our fate.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_StillNot4::
    .string "There should be four.\p"
    .string "Even I cannot read a future half\n"
    .string "written. Complete your party.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaRematchDefeat::
    .string "I did not see it coming.\p"
    .string "For the first time in longer than I can\n"
    .string "recall I was… surprised.\p"
    .string "Thank you.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaRematchBeforeReward::
    .string "You do not know it yet, but this\n"
    .string "belongs to you.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaRematchAfterReward::
    .string "It converts a Pokémon's very life into\n"
    .string "raw power, blow by blow.\p"
    .string "All strength demands its price.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaRematchPostBattle::
    .string "Even now, I cannot see how you did\n"
    .string "it.\p"
    .string "You remain a shadow the future will\n"
    .string "not reveal.\p"
    .string "How wonderful.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaPostRematch::
    .string "It is good to finally dwell in the\n"
    .string "present. Thank you, Champion.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_BagFullOfOtherItems::
    .string "Your Bag is full of other items.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_RematchNotEnoughPlaceholder::
    .string "$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_OfferPCRetrieve::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to organize your party?$"

@Last line about Sabrina

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_AmandaIntro::
    .string "Sabrina is far younger than I,\n"
    .string "but she has earned my respect.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_AmandaDefeat::
    .string "Not good enough!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_AmandaPostBattle::
    .string "In a battle of equals, the one\n"
    .string "with the stronger will wins.\p"
    .string "If you wish to beat Sabrina, focus\n"
    .string "and will yourself to victory.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_JohanIntro::
    .string "Does our unseen power scare you?$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_JohanDefeat::
    .string "I never foresaw this!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_JohanPostBattle::
    .string "Psychic Pokémon fear only ghosts\n"
    .string "and bugs!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_StacyIntro::
    .string "Pokémon take on the appearance of\n"
    .string "their Trainers.\p"
    .string "Your Pokémon must be tough, then!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_StacyDefeat::
    .string "I knew it!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_StacyPostBattle::
    .string "I have much to learn still…\p"
    .string "I must master Psychic and teach it\n"
    .string "to my Pokémon…$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_TyronIntro::
    .string "You understand, don't you?\p"
    .string "That power alone isn't enough to\n"
    .string "win in the world of Pokémon?$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_TyronDefeat::
    .string "I don't believe this!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_TyronPostBattle::
    .string "Sabrina just wiped out the Karate\n"
    .string "Master next door.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_TashaIntro::
    .string "You and I, our Pokémon shall\n"
    .string "battle!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_TashaDefeat::
    .string "I lost after all!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_TashaPostBattle::
    .string "I knew that this was going to take\n"
    .string "place.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_CameronIntro::
    .string "Sabrina is young, but she's also\n"
    .string "our highly skilled .\p"
    .string "You won't reach her easily!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_CameronDefeat::
    .string "Ow!\n"
    .string "Down and out!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_CameronPostBattle::
    .string "There used to be two Pokémon Gyms\n"
    .string "in Saffron.\p"
    .string "The Fighting Dojo next door lost\n"
    .string "its Gym status, though.\p"
    .string "We simply creamed them when we\n"
    .string "decided to have just one Gym.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_PrestonIntro::
    .string "Saffron Pokémon Gym is famous for\n"
    .string "training psychics.\p"
    .string "You want to see Sabrina, don't\n"
    .string "you? I can tell!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_PrestonDefeat::
    .string "Arrrgh!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_PrestonPostBattle::
    .string "That's right! I used telepathy to\n"
    .string "read your mind!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "Sabrina's Pokémon use psychic\n"
    .string "power instead of force.\p"
    .string "Fighting Pokémon are especially\n"
    .string "weak against Psychic Pokémon.\p"
    .string "They'll get destroyed before they\n"
    .string "can even aim a punch!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory::
    .string "Psychic power, huh?\p"
    .string "If I had that, I'd make a bundle\n"
    .string "at the slots!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "Saffron Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Sabrina\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "Saffron Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Sabrina\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"

